   5:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****   * @brief   DMA HAL module driver.
   6:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****   *         This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****   *         functionalities of the Direct Memory Access (DMA) peripheral:
   8:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****   *           + Initialization and de-initialization functions
   9:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****   *           + IO operation functions
  10:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****   *           + Peripheral State and errors functions
