  24:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****   ==============================================================================
  25:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****                         ##### How to use this driver #####
  26:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****   ==============================================================================
  27:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****   [..]
  28:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****    (#) Enable and configure the peripheral to be connected to the DMA Channel
  29:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****        (except for internal SRAM / FLASH memories: no initialization is
  30:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****        necessary). Please refer to the Reference manual for connection between peripherals
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccogJh6P.s 			page 2


  31:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****        and DMA requests.
  32:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c **** 
  33:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****    (#) For a given Channel, program the required configuration through the following parameters:
  34:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****        Channel request, Transfer Direction, Source and Destination data formats,
  35:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****        Circular or Normal mode, Channel Priority level, Source and Destination Increment mode
  36:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****        using HAL_DMA_Init() function.
  37:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c **** 
  38:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****        Prior to HAL_DMA_Init the peripheral clock shall be enabled for both DMA & DMAMUX
  39:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****        thanks to:
  40:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****       (##) DMA1 or DMA2: __HAL_RCC_DMA1_CLK_ENABLE() or  __HAL_RCC_DMA2_CLK_ENABLE() ;
  41:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****       (##) DMAMUX1:      __HAL_RCC_DMAMUX1_CLK_ENABLE();
  42:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c **** 
  43:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****    (#) Use HAL_DMA_GetState() function to return the DMA state and HAL_DMA_GetError() in case of er
  44:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****        detection.
  45:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c **** 
  46:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****    (#) Use HAL_DMA_Abort() function to abort the current transfer
  47:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c **** 
  48:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****      -@-   In Memory-to-Memory transfer mode, Circular mode is not allowed.
  49:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c **** 
  50:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****      *** Polling mode IO operation ***
  51:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****      =================================
  52:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****     [..]
  53:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****           (+) Use HAL_DMA_Start() to start DMA transfer after the configuration of Source
  54:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****               address and destination address and the Length of data to be transferred
  55:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****           (+) Use HAL_DMA_PollForTransfer() to poll for the end of current transfer, in this
  56:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****               case a fixed Timeout can be configured by User depending from his application.
  57:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c **** 
  58:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****      *** Interrupt mode IO operation ***
  59:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****      ===================================
  60:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****     [..]
  61:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****           (+) Configure the DMA interrupt priority using HAL_NVIC_SetPriority()
  62:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****           (+) Enable the DMA IRQ handler using HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ()
  63:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****           (+) Use HAL_DMA_Start_IT() to start DMA transfer after the configuration of
  64:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****               Source address and destination address and the Length of data to be transferred.
  65:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****               In this case the DMA interrupt is configured
  66:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****           (+) Use HAL_DMA_IRQHandler() called under DMA_IRQHandler() Interrupt subroutine
  67:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****           (+) At the end of data transfer HAL_DMA_IRQHandler() function is executed and user can
  68:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****               add his own function to register callbacks with HAL_DMA_RegisterCallback().
  69:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c **** 
  70:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****      *** DMA HAL driver macros list ***
  71:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****      =============================================
  72:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****       [..]
  73:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****        Below the list of macros in DMA HAL driver.
  74:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c **** 
  75:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****        (+) __HAL_DMA_ENABLE: Enable the specified DMA Channel.
  76:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****        (+) __HAL_DMA_DISABLE: Disable the specified DMA Channel.
  77:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****        (+) __HAL_DMA_GET_FLAG: Get the DMA Channel pending flags.
  78:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****        (+) __HAL_DMA_CLEAR_FLAG: Clear the DMA Channel pending flags.
  79:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****        (+) __HAL_DMA_ENABLE_IT: Enable the specified DMA Channel interrupts.
  80:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****        (+) __HAL_DMA_DISABLE_IT: Disable the specified DMA Channel interrupts.
  81:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****        (+) __HAL_DMA_GET_IT_SOURCE: Check whether the specified DMA Channel interrupt has occurred 
  82:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c **** 
  83:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****      [..]
  84:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****       (@) You can refer to the DMA HAL driver header file for more useful macros
  85:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c **** 
  86:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****   @endverbatim
  87:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****   */
