 145:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c **** /**
 146:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****   * @brief  Initialize the DMA according to the specified
 147:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****   *         parameters in the DMA_InitTypeDef and initialize the associated handle.
 148:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****   * @param  hdma Pointer to a DMA_HandleTypeDef structure that contains
 149:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_dma.c ****   *               the configuration information for the specified DMA Channel.
